{# Canine Drives: the dog's strongest bodily needs. canine_needs is empty for everyone else and when he is content.
   The name check guards against SkyrimNet handing the decorators another actor than npc (seen with an NPC that had no bio). #}
{{ canine_seen(npc.UUID) }}{% set canineNeeds = canine_needs(npc.UUID) %}
{% if canineNeeds and canine_name(npc.UUID) == decnpc(npc.UUID).name %}
## What {{ decnpc(npc.UUID).name }}'s Body Wants Right Now
{{ canineNeeds }}
{% endif %}
